{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "498ba315-4b59-82f4-a62e-95f38f002dee",
  "created_at": "2026-02-06T11:56:38-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Finance",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Holly Gardiner",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Luis Barros",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-06T11:54:38-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Finance department, this is Luis. Almost lunchtime on a Friday, so make it a good one."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-06T11:54:44-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hello, yes, good morning. I am calling about my property tax bill. The, the square footage is wrong for my house."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-06T11:54:52-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. What does the bill say, and what do you think it should be?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-06T11:54:57-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It say two thousand four hundred square feet. Is not that big, no. Is more like fourteen hundred, [line breaks up] maybe less."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-06T11:55:05-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You cut out a little there. Did you say fourteen hundred?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-06T11:55:09-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, fourteen hundred. One-four-zero-zero."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-06T11:55:11-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it. What's the address on the bill?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-06T11:55:15-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Two ninety-one Spring Street, in the Fifth Ward."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-06T11:55:19-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, 291 Spring. Square footage comes from the assessor's records, so I can't change it from here. I'll send you to the assessor's office and they can look at the property record. They may want to see something that shows the real size."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-06T11:55:34-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, okay. I have the paper from when we buy the house, I can look. Also, I need to ask, how I change the mailing address? The bill go to my old place, [inaudible] my daughter's house."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-06T11:55:47-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sorry, the bill goes where now?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-06T11:55:50-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "To the old address. I want it to come to the house, to Spring Street."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-06T11:55:56-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Right. You can send a written request with your name, the property address and the new mailing address. Or the assessor's office can update it when you talk to them about the square footage. Easiest to do both at once."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-06T11:56:10-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good, that is good. Because I am the only one in my family who talk to the government offices, so everything is me. [crosstalk] My husband, no, he does not call."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-06T11:56:21-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Understood. Want me to transfer you over to the assessor now?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-06T11:56:25-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes please, transfer me. If it cut, my number is four-oh-one, five-five-five, zero-one-six-four."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-06T11:56:30-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Four-oh-one, five-five-five, zero-one-six-four. Got it. Hold on, Ms. Gardiner, putting you through."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-06T11:56:35-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thank you very much. Bye-bye."
    }
  ],
